facts? Does archive feel safe?", "manual_simulation": "Nav to Artifacts. See list. Try j/k, Enter (preview), Space (archive), f (filter), a (download).", "passes": false, "priority": "p1", "incentive": "artifact management; users want to see agent output", "status": "proposed", "op": "create", "agent": "seed-internal-tui", "ts": "2026-05-17T18:08:20.492762"}
