te), d (delete with confirm).", "passes": false, "priority": "p0", "incentive": "docs are part of work; TUI must support H3 (document work)", "status": "proposed", "op": "create", "agent": "seed-internal-tui", "ts": "2026-05-17T18:08:20.492762"}
