ind related entities?", "manual_simulation": "From nav, go to Search. Type a query (e.g., 'planning'). See results group by kind. Try P (project filter), Tab (next group), Enter (detail).", "passes": false, "priority": "p1", "incentive": "human journey H5 (search, memory, context); cross-project visibility", "status": "proposed", "op": "create", "agent": "seed-internal-tui", "ts": "2026-05-17T18:08:20.492762"}
