sy to find unresolved comments?", "Can resolved comments be unresolve if needed?"], "manual_simulation": "1. Open doc with comments\n2. Click 'Resolve' on 'Spelling fix' comment\n3. Verify comment grayed out + shows 'Resolved by you on [date]'\n4. Try to click Resolve again \u2192 shows Reopen button\n5. Click Reopen \u2192 comment returns to normal\n6. Filter to 'Unresolved only' \u2192 excludes resolved\n7. Show resolved \u2192 resolved comments appear", "passes": false, "priority": "p1", "incentive": "Resolved state provides feedback loop for iterative feedback", "status": "proposed", "op": "create", "agent": "seed-docmost-search", "ts": "2026-05-17T15:09:45.148795"}
