ync properly in multi-user editing?"], "manual_simulation": "1. Open doc\n2. Highlight 'architecture decision' text \u2192 comment 'Need consensus'\n3. Verify inline highlight + margin pin appears at that line\n4. Hover pin \u2192 preview shows 'Need consensus'\n5. Scroll \u2192 pin moves with content\n6. Highlight another section \u2192 2nd pin appears\n7. Click margin pin \u2192 sidebar opens with thread\n8. Resolve comment \u2192 pin fades\n9. Reload page \u2192 pins still present", "passes": false, "priority": "p1", "incentive": "Inline markers prevent comment discovery friction", "status": "proposed", "op": "create", "agent": "seed-docmost-search", "ts": "2026-05-17T15:09:45.148795"}
