ts to last content, deletedAt cleared"], "critique_focus": ["Is edit/delete permission clearly enforced?", "Is deletion actually soft-delete (recoverable)?", "Can users see edit history?", "Is restore limited to reasonable time window?"], "manual_simulation": "1. Comment on page: 'This is my feedback'\n2. 30 min later, click 3-dot \u2192 Edit\n3. Change to 'Updated feedback' \u2192 Save\n4. Verify timestamp shows 'Edited 30 min ago'\n5. Click Delete \u2192 confirm\n6. Verify tombstone shown + Restore button\n7. Click Restore \u2192 comment back with original edit mark\n8. Try to edit comment from other user \u2192 menu disabled (no edit option)", "passes": false, "priority": "p2", "incentive": "Edit trail and soft-delete balance expression with safety", "status": "proposed", "op": "create", "agent": "seed-docmost-search", "ts": "2026-05-17T15:09:45.148795"}
